--- smart bone dials ---
keys are hit exactly
key weights are a partition of unity
past the ends it holds, it does not run away
with overshoot off, nothing leaves the bracket
with overshoot on, it overshoots but stays sane
the correction is smooth, with no step at a key
a dial may not drive its own driver
two dials on one bone multiply, they do not average
a stretch is held above nothing
re-posing at the same angle replaces, it does not stack
removing a dial does not renumber the others
saving and loading gives back the same dial
a file with keys out of order still resolves
nothing at all is answered calmly
thirty dials resolve in front of a finger
point offsets follow the same weights as bone turns
2003 checks, 0 failures
